{"reviews":[{"id":"B07H23KW68-0","r":5.0,"t":"Will order again, best eyebrow pen ever!!","x":"Best eyebrow stuff I have ever used, stays on looks great!!! Easy to use WILL ORDER AGAIN!","h":26,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-1","r":5.0,"t":"My New Favorite Product","x":"I love love love this product.  My skin is super sensitive and a lot of other products tend to make me itchy & I end up rubbing my eyebrows off. This stuff not only lasts ALL day & the tip makes it practically dumby proof to apply. My brows look the best they have in years!","h":22,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-2","r":5.0,"t":"Updated Review - This seller is amazing!","x":"So my original item was defective. I returned the item and received my replacement within 48hrs and then Caroline H. contacted me to make sure I was satisfied with everything, then she stated that their policy is 100% customer satisfaction and because I was not pleased initially she refunded my money as well. I'd definitely do business with this seller again. As for the product initially the replacement worked fine for about a day beyond that I found that I almost had to have the pen/marker 100%","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-3","r":3.0,"t":"dried up after 4 days","x":"The first day it worked great the second day not as good, by the 4 day it was totally dried up. Customer service was quick to respond with a full refund.","h":20,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-4","r":3.0,"t":"I didn't like that it.s a marker.","x":"It.s like a marker not pencil. If you mess up and it dries it will not whipe off. You have to use soap or alcohol several times.  You have to be very very light-handed for this or it.ll look crazy. This needs to be made out of a pencil not marker and it.ll be nice.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-5","r":4.0,"t":"The seller is very nice and replaced the defective item.","x":"The first item I received was defective. The seller reached out and was very nice to replace the item. Upon receiving the new item it was not dried out like the first. That was really nice of them. Very good customer service.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-6","r":2.0,"t":"Did not work for me","x":"Did not go on as advertised. More like water color paint. Seller did accept return of the product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-7","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Worst! Don\u2019t waste your money. All the other reviews saying that it dries out and doesn\u2019t work after 1-2 uses are true. Ink not as dark as it looked online and stopped working after a few uses.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-8","r":1.0,"t":"trash. don't waist time or money.","x":"this product is great in theory but in application, not worth it. it doesn't apply to the brow like it does to the hand nor does it look good when applied.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-9","r":3.0,"t":"Not as durable","x":"I like that this product is water proof but the tip can fray easily. If it was more durable and kept its shape I\u2019d give it a 5 but for now it\u2019s a 3","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-10","r":3.0,"t":"Double check your colors","x":"I bought this product in Brown & I\u2019ve found it has a very red tint to it. Also it does wash off with water.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-11","r":2.0,"t":"No much liquid inside only use it twice","x":"I really like this product but I only used it 2 times. And now it seems like it has no more products side.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-12","r":2.0,"t":"No much liquid inside only use it twice","x":"I really like this product but I only used it 2 times. And now it seems like it has no more products side.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-13","r":1.0,"t":"Good customer service.","x":"Product wasn\u2019t what I expected but they were very good in refunding my money to take care of it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-14","r":3.0,"t":"Nah...","x":"Nothing special! Clears away from my eyebrows after few touches....","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-15","r":1.0,"t":"Bled","x":"Waste of money! Don\u2019t buy! Doesn\u2019t work. Should be zero star!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-16","r":1.0,"t":"Messy and not easy to apply","x":"Color was not what I expected and it was very messy.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-17","r":1.0,"t":"Waste of money","x":"Don\u2019t waste your money, this did not work.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-18","r":1.0,"t":"It Doesn\u2019t Work & It\u2019s Definitely Dried Out","x":"It\u2019s More Of A Light Brown Watered Down Look & It Appears To Be Dried Out. I Opened It For 1st Time Today For An Engagement & Now I Have To Be Inconvenienced To Go Out & Purchase Another Brand (That\u2019s A \u201cName Brand\u201d This Time!) To Take It\u2019s Place. It\u2019s Just Like Permanent Marker That Has Dried Out Prior To Use!!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-19","r":1.0,"t":"No product!","x":"I was looking forward to using this product. Even though it came wrapped, very little tint was  coming out of the pen. Shook it several times and again barely any product coming out. I will not return it just because I dont have time, but very unsatisfied. Btw  does not come out hairlike!","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-20","r":3.0,"t":"Color slightly off","x":"I was excited to receive the product and reay to try, unfortunately the Brown color I ordered was a little more on the red side and not a good match for me. Perhaps a dark brown would have been a better match. I thought black would be to bold for my skin color (fair Olive toned) .","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-21","r":3.0,"t":"Crayon Brown...","x":"After a few uses, the felt tip wore down and it no longer makes the \"hair-like\" strokes advertised. Also the color is a bit off--it reminds me of \"crayon\" brown as opposed to a natural hair color. I still use it, but probably will not repurchase once it is gone.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-22","r":1.0,"t":"Like using a defective marker.","x":"No. Just, no. The brown is very red. And it\u2019s like trying to use a dried out marker that occasionally leaks. The lines are not defined, and when you shake it, it\u2019s like a leaky pen for one or two strokes, then just random smudges.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-23","r":1.0,"t":"Dries out quickly and burns skin","x":"Loved this at first. Applicator tip is amazing even though the product burns skin slightly. This was stored tip down, cap secured and still dried out in a matter of days. Used twice. Nice idea but not worth the money.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2019"},{"id":"B07H23KW68-24","r":2.0,"t":"Nothing special","x":"This brow makeup is nothing special.  The end is supposed to mimic fine hair but it really doesn't probably because the flow is inconsistent.  I gave it two star because the cost is low and the color is nice.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers praise the product as easy to use and long-lasting, with some calling it their favorite eyebrow product.","cites":[1,2]},{"text":"A common complaint is that the product dries out or runs out of ink after only a few uses.","cites":[4,8,12,13]},{"text":"Several reviewers report receiving defective items, but note that customer service responded quickly with replacements or refunds.","cites":[3,4,6,14]},{"text":"Some reviewers dislike the marker-style applicator, finding it hard to control, difficult to remove, or prone to fraying.","cites":[5,10]},{"text":"A few reviewers say the product does not apply or look as advertised, including color and water-resistance issues.","cites":[7,9,11,15]}]},"qa":[]}